---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const testimonials = [
  {
    name: "Jukka Palosaari",
    role: "Director of Engineering, Relex Solutions",
    postSlug: "2025-02-19-jukka-palosaari-testimonial",
    quote: [
      "Miguel organized everything for us, we just had to join the workshops and get immediate value from them. We invested a bit, but the outcome is huge. Even if no further actions are taken, simply doing the workshops shows you what the bottlenecks are, what's slowing you down, and what is hurting the processes.",
    ]
  },
  {
    name: "Iker Garagarza",
    role: "Director of Engineering, Relex Solutions",
    postSlug: "2025-02-17-iker-garagarza-testimonial",
    quote: [
      "All the workshops led us to the outcome we were expecting and got a good overview on areas we could improve to make the whole process more efficient. It was great to see the whole process, Miguel's facilitation skills as well as his VSM expertise.",
    ]
  },
  {
    name: "Mark Sadler",
    role: "Program Director, Relex Solutions",
    postSlug: "2025-03-06-mark-sadler-testimonial",
    quote: [
      "I always found Miguel excellent to work with and he added value whenever he was involved. He was always passionate with a great drive and took ownership of the work he was responsible for. He communicated very well with stakeholders at all levels and led meetings confidently and in a very organised manner.",
    ]
  },
  {
    name: "Mika Schafroth",
    role: "Director of Engineering, Relex Solutions",
    postSlug: "2025-02-17-mika-schafroth-testimonial",
    quote: [
      "The value stream mapping Miguel organized for our Identity Service team had several impacts. On one side, a tremendous potential was unveiled how the process of deploying changes can be improved. On the other, it was a great team building exercise.",
    ]
  }
];
---

<Layout title="Miguel Dias - DevOps & Value Stream Mapping">
  <main>
    <!-- Hero + Work With Me: one flow, no banding -->
    <section id="offerings" class="py-16 md:py-24 px-4 bg-white text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Hero: headline + subtitle only, optional small Book a call -->
        <div class="text-center mb-14 md:mb-16">
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4">
            Improve Your Software<br />
            Delivery
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[rgb(33,48,118)]/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            I help teams deliver software faster and with higher quality with Value Stream Mapping and DevOps.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Social proof band -->
        <div data-social-proof class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 md:gap-8 mb-10 md:mb-12 text-center md:text-left">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 italic max-w-md">
            "A tremendous potential was unveiled how the process of deploying changes can be improved."
            <span class="block not-italic font-semibold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mt-1">&mdash; Mika Schafroth, Director of Engineering (Relex Solutions)</span>
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-block bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] text-[rgb(33,48,118)] font-semibold text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">64% lead time reduction</span>
            <span class="inline-block bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] text-[rgb(33,48,118)] font-semibold text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Monthly &rarr; Weekly deployments</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service cards: clear CTAs by intent -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <a
            href="/workshops/intro"
            data-offering="short-workshop"
            class="block bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-transparent hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/20 group"
          >
            <img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="VSM intro workshop" class="w-full h-[130px] object-cover" />
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">1h30 training</p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-3 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">Introduction to Value Stream Mapping for Leaders</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Map your delivery, spot bottlenecks, leave with a plan. Hands-on session for engineering and product leaders.</p>
              <span data-cta class="inline-block bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors">Learn more</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/workshops/facilitation"
            data-offering="facilitation-training"
            class="block bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-transparent hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/20 group"
          >
            <img src="/images/workshops/image2.jpg" alt="VSM facilitation workshop" class="w-full h-[130px] object-cover" />
            <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">5 sessions &times; 1h30</p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-3 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">VSM &amp; Flow Engineering Facilitation Training</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Learn to run full VSM workshops yourself. Templates, coaching, and your team's real challenges.</p>
              <span data-cta class="inline-block bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors">Learn more</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How We Work Section -->
    <section id="how-we-work" class="py-20 px-4 bg-[#001C46]">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Resources Carousel -->
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8 text-white">Resources</h2>
        <div class="relative mb-16" data-resources-carousel>
          <!-- Carousel track -->
          <div class="flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scroll-smooth pb-4 -mx-4 px-4 md:px-0 md:mx-0 scrollbar-hide" id="carousel-track">
            <!-- 1. Blog: What is VSM? -->
            <a
              href="/blog/2025-05-19-what-is-vsm/"
              data-carousel-item="blog"
              class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
            >
              <img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="What is Value Stream Mapping?" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
              <div class="p-5">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Article</p>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">What is Value Stream Mapping?</h3>
                <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">VSM helps teams achieve a specific business outcome by improving work processes. Teams visualize the flow of work, identify inefficiencies, and create a roadmap of measurable improvements.</p>
                <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Read article &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 2. YouTube Short: Workshop Overview -->
            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/FGXKSSGeUX4"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-carousel-item="short"
              class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
            >
              <div class="relative w-full h-48 overflow-hidden">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/FGXKSSGeUX4/hqdefault.jpg" alt="VSM Workshop Overview" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/30">
                  <svg class="w-14 h-14 text-white/90" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Video &middot; 1 min</p>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">Value Stream Mapping Workshop Overview</h3>
                <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">A quick walkthrough of what happens in a Value Stream Mapping workshop and the outcomes teams can expect.</p>
                <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Watch &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- 3. YouTube: Full Workshop Recording -->
            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kii61nkkqfY"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-carousel-item="talk"
              class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85vw] md:w-[calc(33.333%-1rem)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white/10 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 transition-all group"
            >
              <div class="relative w-full h-48 overflow-hidden">
                <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/kii61nkkqfY/hqdefault.jpg" alt="VSM Workshop Talk" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/30">
                  <svg class="w-14 h-14 text-white/90" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-2">Talk &middot; 33 min</p>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)] transition-colors">How to Map the Value Stream to Deliver Software 2x Faster</h3>
                <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4">Erica Engelen and I break down how to map the value stream to deliver software 2x faster while maintaining quality.</p>
                <span class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium text-sm">Watch &rarr;</span>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

        <style>
          .scrollbar-hide::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
          .scrollbar-hide { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
        </style>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What Clients Say Section -->
    <section id="testimonial" class="py-20 px-4 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)]">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">What Clients Say</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          {testimonials.map(testimonial => (
            <blockquote class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md">
              <div class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-lg italic">
                <p>"{testimonial.quote[0]}</p>
                {testimonial.quote.slice(1).map(paragraph => (
                  <p class="mt-4">{paragraph}{paragraph === testimonial.quote[testimonial.quote.length - 1] ? '"' : ''}</p>
                ))}
              </div>
              <footer class="space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                  <div>
                    <cite class="text-[rgb(33,48,118)] font-bold not-italic">{testimonial.name}</cite>
                    <p class="text-gray-500">{testimonial.role}</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <a
                  href={`/blog/${testimonial.postSlug}`}
                  class="inline-block text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:text-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90 font-medium transition-colors"
                >
                  Read Full Testimonial &rarr;
                </a>
              </footer>
            </blockquote>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Case Study Section -->
    <section id="case-study" class="py-20 px-4 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Case Study</h2>
        <div class="bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-8 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">The Challenge</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
            A platform engineering team struggled with long lead times of 28 days between code push and production deployment. An inter-team dependency slowed the team down and deployment feedback arrived later than desired. The team wanted to prevent issues from reaching the customer, and wanted faster feedback on deployments, so they could fix any issues faster.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Our Approach</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-8 space-y-2">
            <li>Held a Value Stream Mapping workshop to identify bottlenecks, collaboration gaps, and delayed handoffs.</li>
            <li>Created a roadmap that empowered every developer to participate in deployments and detect potential issues earlier.</li>
            <li>Collaborated with change management to set weekly deployment windows, so the team could plan effectively and integrate improvements gradually.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">The Outcome</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>64% Lead Time Reduction</strong>: Time from code completion to live deployment dropped from 28 to 10 days &mdash; delivering value more often.</li>
            <li><strong>Team Ownership</strong>: Every developer understands the deployment process and can execute it, removing single points of failure.</li>
            <li><strong>Fewer Surprises</strong>: Shifting quality checks earlier means potential issues are found sooner, reducing the cost of more expensive unplanned work.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Ready to Improve Section -->
    <section id="contact" class="py-20 px-4 bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Ready to Improve Your Software Delivery?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8">
          Whether you're a small team or a large organization, I can help you deliver more often, discover problems earlier, and improve cross-team collaboration.
        </p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/migueldiaseu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track-book-call="ready-to-improve" class="inline-block bg-white hover:bg-white/90 text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg transition-colors">
          Book a Call
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
